      "summary": "Sjögren's often causes dry eyes and dry mouth and can involve other organs. NHS: GP/rheumatology pathways; lubricating drops and dental care help dryness — never invent immunosuppressant doses. Emergency: sudden severe breathlessness, chest pain, high fever with confusion, or sudden vision loss.",
